f Oct 12, the record for Yancey County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025, November to December ran 47% of normal on the middle of the grids, and October to November ran 65%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 48% of normal and June to July at 122%.</p>"}
